  "duration_s": 609.801995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "他喂给亲儿子的那口药，救了全中国的孩子。各位，我先撂下一句，掏心窝子的话，你品品这天底下最疼孩子的爹，不是把孩子挡在身后的那个，而是敢把刀尖儿朝自己娃身上捅的那个。今儿个要说的这位就是这么一个当爸的，他干了一桩，听着就脊背发凉的事，把自个儿的青骨肉当成了第一只试药的兔子，它叫顾方舟。这名你可能生熟，可他捣鼓出来的东西，你打小就尝过，就是那颗黄澄澄甜丝丝的淌丸，咱把把历历往回翻个大跟头。那是五十年代的事儿。一种阳名叫脊髓灰质炎的瘟神，冷不丁就闯进了咱们的日子，老百姓嘴里的叫法更直白。小儿麻痹症这玩意儿专挑小娃娃下手，六七岁以下的最倒霉，头一天还活蹦乱跳的宰，稍一退抽两下金两条腿就跟不是自己的似的软了歪了，这辈子都别想再稳当当的走路轻的呢，缺一辈子重的，连喘气的劲儿都被他抽干，活活给憋死。最叫我忘不掉的是江苏南通，那回没多少功夫，一千出头的孩子就摊在了皇上，四百多个小命就这么没了。那股子邪火眨眼就窜到了青岛、上海、南宁，家家户户吓得门栓插的死死的，死活不让马往外头迈一步，医院大门口全是抱着孩子跪地上嚎啕的爹妈。可那会儿的新中国兜里比脸还干净，没要没人会治。大夫除了叹气，啥辙也没用，上头急眼了，把这千斤重担撂给了一个三十来岁的小伙子，顾方舟把苏联啃了几年。病毒学刚回国没多久，摆在他眼前的是两条道头，一条是洋人。美国的死疫苗稳妥是稳妥，可一针就要十块美金，这病还分好几个型号，得一针一针的，挨一个人少说也得三针。那年月，一个普通人，一个月拢共就挣几十块人民币，你让老百姓上哪弄这笔钱，国库也经不起这么躁。第二条道叫活疫苗便宜，顶多算死。疫苗的千分之一还能兑水里喝下去，瞅着是真香，可全世界没一个敢往人，身上招魂的病毒是活的呀，万一没驯服利索，哇，喝下去，反倒真摊上这病，那不成害人了吗？一边是保险，可绝大多数人够不着，一边是便宜，可谁心里也没底。顾方舟，把后槽牙一咬走，活疫苗那条道，凭啥？因为他心里装着的是全国千千万万嗷嗷待哺的小婴儿，不是一个两个有钱人的太平。他自个儿说的实在死，疫苗是自个儿图省事的法子，活疫苗才是给千百万个家正处的一条活路。一九五九年，他从苏联好歹把活疫苗的门道连同几份金贵的种子材料带了回来。可一落地就傻眼，压根没地儿做实验，要拿动武事就得有恒。和侯北京城里一纸能用的都寻不着，咋整？搬上云南昆明边上那片大山，慌得兔子都不拉屎，不通路，没水没电。顾方舟干了一桩，让大伙扶起到骨头里的事儿。他把自个儿的亲娘媳妇，还有刚落地的小儿子，一大家子全从北京碾上了山屠杀。他要给中国盖头，一座几会疫苗的研究所，还得给手底下的人立个杆瞧瞧，瞅见没我家当家的都来了，你们还哆嗦个啥？科研人员住的是窝棚，是山洞，连间像人住的屋子都抠不出来。做实验的料子，得先送到山脚下的冷库里，镇着要用的时候再吭哧吭哧扛回来，就这么个苦哈哈的境地，一回又一回的事。熬到一九六零年，疫苗总算捣鼓出来了，猴子身上没毛病。可猴没事儿不代表人，没事儿啊。谁敢头一个往嘴里灌，谁又敢往娃嘴里灌？接下来这墓是全篇最叫人后脊梁冒凉气的一段，顾方舟先抄起一瓶自个儿灌了个底朝天，同时一把拦住顾老师，您可是带头的，您要有个闪失，后头可咋整？他甩出一句硬邦邦的话，我是党员，我先来猴子，他不会开口，可我会只有拿自个儿身子试过，我才最明白这玩意儿进到人肚子里是个啥动静。紧跟着好几个年轻科研人员也呼啦一下站起来，我也是党员，算我一个这帮人，就是咱中国头一搏，拿命是药的硬汉。结果咋样一个不少全都安然无恙。可顾方舟胸口那块石头愣是没落地，因为他冷不丁琢磨出一个要命的坎儿。他是大人，大人早就被这病毒磨除抵抗力了。可这病真正要人命的对象是那些三五岁的奶娃娃，大人喝了不碍事，不等于孩子喝了也不碍事啊。那么问题就明晃晃的处在那了，谁他娘的舍得拿自家的娃去烫这道雷下头这一段是我听过最揪心、最拧巴的父爱那阵子。顾方舟最小的儿子刚落地没多久，他做了一个往后余生都在担惊受怕的决定。他瞒着伯姨悄悄的把那馆几回活疫苗喂尽了亲儿子的嘴。你把那画面在脑子里过一遍，一个专攻病毒的专家亲手霸一馆，说不定要命的药水。一滴一滴滴进自己青蛙的嘴里，赌赢了娃平平安安，赌输了他的心头肉，轻则贪一辈子，重则把命搭进去。他后来念叨起这事儿，语气平淡的像在说隔壁老张家的闲篇不这么干不成啊，你自己都不嫌尝，你咋好意思让别人去尝，你让人家去试，你自个儿良心过得去。大伙儿听听这哪是心狠哪，分明是把刀刃对准了自己身上最软最疼的那块肉。他那口子那边是彻彻底底被蒙在鼓里的那一个月，顾方舟天天半宿半宿的爬起来，摸娃的脑门儿，丁娃抽不抽筋儿，白天还得装的跟没事人一样，足足熬了一个月。眼看儿子好好的一丁点差子，没有，他才敢跟媳妇儿挑明。爱人一听又气又后怕，半天，憋不出一个字，哪个当娘的扛得住。这种惊吓，可就是这么个狼心狗肺的爹，换回了千千万万个孩子的太平打那儿往后对比其他科研人员的侍灵娃也陆陆续续跟着服了疫苗，入了观察组，这帮科研人员的宰成了咱中国头一波被唐玩护住的孩子。后来呢，顾方舟嫌那液体的疫苗又苦又难伺候，脑子一转，干脆做成糖丸呗，我爱吃，还耐放好搬运。打从六七十年代起，糖丸就在全国撒开了，再犄角旮旯的山沟沟瓦也能美滋滋的，含上一颗结局，咱都晓得了。九十年代后，半截中国大地上再没冒出过一粒本土的小儿麻痹症跨进新世纪。没多久，顾方舟代表中国在消灭几回的认证书上，一笔一划签下了自个儿的名，他是拿亲儿子的命去赌，赌赢了整整一代中国孩子的安康。顾方舟，于二零一九年一月二日三时三十五分，在北京因病世事，享年九十二岁。说到这儿，我这眼眶是发烫的当爹。当妈的都明白，孩子是身上掉下来的肉，是命里的命。可顾方舟硬生生把这块肉弯下来去填了全天下的娃，这样的人不该被遗忘。所以今儿个这条视频，你要是也被戳着了，就点个赞，收个藏，顺手转给你身边的亲朋，让咱们的娃娃的娃都晓得咱们今儿个能撒鸭子跑，能蹦能跳能疯能闹。是因为老早以前有人把命压在了咱们身上，记着他顾方舟，唐湾爷爷。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1890,
      "text": "他喂给亲儿子的那口药，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2830,
      "end_ms": 4510,
      "text": "救了全中国的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5410,
      "end_ms": 5830,
      "text": "各位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6770,
      "end_ms": 8210,
      "text": "我先撂下一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8430,
      "end_ms": 9770,
      "text": "掏心窝子的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11390,
      "end_ms": 16525,
      "text": "你品品这天底下最疼孩子的爹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18460,
      "end_ms": 21040,
      "text": "不是把孩子挡在身后的那个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21480,
      "end_ms": 25880,
      "text": "而是敢把刀尖儿朝自己娃身上捅的那个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25880,
      "end_ms": 29260,
      "text": "今儿个要说的这位就是这么一个当爸的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29260,
      "end_ms": 30080,
      "text": "他干了一桩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 31540,
      "text": "听着就脊背发凉的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31540,
      "end_ms": 35900,
      "text": "把自个儿的青骨肉当成了第一只试药的兔子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35900,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "它叫顾方舟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37940,
      "end_ms": 39180,
      "text": "这名你可能生熟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39260,
      "end_ms": 40680,
      "text": "可他捣鼓出来的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00016",
      "start_ms": 41020,
      "end_ms": 42360,
      "text": "你打小就尝过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42480,
      "end_ms": 45360,
      "text": "就是那颗黄澄澄甜丝丝的淌丸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45960,
      "end_ms": 49050,
      "text": "咱把把历历往回翻个大跟头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49490,
      "end_ms": 51190,
      "text": "那是五十年代的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51470,
      "end_ms": 54610,
      "text": "一种阳名叫脊髓灰质炎的瘟神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54990,
      "end_ms": 57170,
      "text": "冷不丁就闯进了咱们的日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58030,
      "end_ms": 60030,
      "text": "老百姓嘴里的叫法更直白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60290,
      "end_ms": 64175,
      "text": "小儿麻痹症这玩意儿专挑小娃娃下手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64620,
      "end_ms": 66785,
      "text": "六七岁以下的最倒霉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00025",
      "start_ms": 67660,
      "end_ms": 69640,
      "text": "头一天还活蹦乱跳的宰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69940,
      "end_ms": 76230,
      "text": "稍一退抽两下金两条腿就跟不是自己的似的软了歪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00027",
      "start_ms": 76370,
      "end_ms": 81250,
      "text": "这辈子都别想再稳当当的走路轻的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00028",
      "start_ms": 81470,
      "end_ms": 83145,
      "text": "缺一辈子重的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00029",
      "start_ms": 83420,
      "end_ms": 85785,
      "text": "连喘气的劲儿都被他抽干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00030",
      "start_ms": 86410,
      "end_ms": 87625,
      "text": "活活给憋死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00031",
      "start_ms": 88110,
      "end_ms": 91380,
      "text": "最叫我忘不掉的是江苏南通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00032",
      "start_ms": 91500,
      "end_ms": 93605,
      "text": "那回没多少功夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94030,
      "end_ms": 97475,
      "text": "一千出头的孩子就摊在了皇上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00034",
      "start_ms": 98610,
      "end_ms": 102495,
      "text": "四百多个小命就这么没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00035",
      "start_ms": 102950,
      "end_ms": 107055,
      "text": "那股子邪火眨眼就窜到了青岛、上海、南宁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00036",
      "start_ms": 107550,
      "end_ms": 109970,
      "text": "家家户户吓得门栓插的死死的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00037",
      "start_ms": 109970,
      "end_ms": 112195,
      "text": "死活不让马往外头迈一步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00038",
      "start_ms": 112930,
      "end_ms": 117235,
      "text": "医院大门口全是抱着孩子跪地上嚎啕的爹妈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00039",
      "start_ms": 117980,
      "end_ms": 121210,
      "text": "可那会儿的新中国兜里比脸还干净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00040",
      "start_ms": 121210,
      "end_ms": 122915,
      "text": "没要没人会治。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00041",
      "start_ms": 123380,
      "end_ms": 124685,
      "text": "大夫除了叹气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00042",
      "start_ms": 125060,
      "end_ms": 125815,
      "text": "啥辙也没用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00043",
      "start_ms": 126700,
      "end_ms": 127585,
      "text": "上头急眼了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00044",
      "start_ms": 128080,
      "end_ms": 132460,
      "text": "把这千斤重担撂给了一个三十来岁的小伙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00045",
      "start_ms": 132460,
      "end_ms": 135590,
      "text": "顾方舟把苏联啃了几年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00046",
      "start_ms": 135610,
      "end_ms": 138235,
      "text": "病毒学刚回国没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00047",
      "start_ms": 138640,
      "end_ms": 142080,
      "text": "摆在他眼前的是两条道头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00048",
      "start_ms": 142080,
      "end_ms": 143630,
      "text": "一条是洋人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00049",
      "start_ms": 143630,
      "end_ms": 146465,
      "text": "美国的死疫苗稳妥是稳妥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00050",
      "start_ms": 146730,
      "end_ms": 148885,
      "text": "可一针就要十块美金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00051",
      "start_ms": 149500,
      "end_ms": 151165,
      "text": "这病还分好几个型号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00052",
      "start_ms": 151480,
      "end_ms": 152880,
      "text": "得一针一针的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00053",
      "start_ms": 152880,
      "end_ms": 155665,
      "text": "挨一个人少说也得三针。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00054",
      "start_ms": 156300,
      "end_ms": 156900,
      "text": "那年月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00055",
      "start_ms": 157060,
      "end_ms": 157880,
      "text": "一个普通人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00056",
      "start_ms": 157880,
      "end_ms": 159880,
      "text": "一个月拢共就挣几十块人民币，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00057",
      "start_ms": 159880,
      "end_ms": 161665,
      "text": "你让老百姓上哪弄这笔钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00058",
      "start_ms": 162300,
      "end_ms": 163775,
      "text": "国库也经不起这么躁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00059",
      "start_ms": 164810,
      "end_ms": 169165,
      "text": "第二条道叫活疫苗便宜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00060",
      "start_ms": 169840,
      "end_ms": 170880,
      "text": "顶多算死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00061",
      "start_ms": 170920,
      "end_ms": 174925,
      "text": "疫苗的千分之一还能兑水里喝下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00062",
      "start_ms": 175820,
      "end_ms": 177035,
      "text": "瞅着是真香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00063",
      "start_ms": 177970,
      "end_ms": 180410,
      "text": "可全世界没一个敢往人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00064",
      "start_ms": 180410,
      "end_ms": 182510,
      "text": "身上招魂的病毒是活的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00065",
      "start_ms": 182550,
      "end_ms": 184315,
      "text": "万一没驯服利索，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00066",
      "start_ms": 184670,
      "end_ms": 184850,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184850,
      "end_ms": 185450,
      "text": "喝下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00068",
      "start_ms": 185450,
      "end_ms": 186865,
      "text": "反倒真摊上这病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00069",
      "start_ms": 187160,
      "end_ms": 188325,
      "text": "那不成害人了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00070",
      "start_ms": 188830,
      "end_ms": 189955,
      "text": "一边是保险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00071",
      "start_ms": 190230,
      "end_ms": 191915,
      "text": "可绝大多数人够不着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00072",
      "start_ms": 192320,
      "end_ms": 193405,
      "text": "一边是便宜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00073",
      "start_ms": 194090,
      "end_ms": 195295,
      "text": "可谁心里也没底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00074",
      "start_ms": 195940,
      "end_ms": 196520,
      "text": "顾方舟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00075",
      "start_ms": 196520,
      "end_ms": 198320,
      "text": "把后槽牙一咬走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00076",
      "start_ms": 198340,
      "end_ms": 199415,
      "text": "活疫苗那条道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00077",
      "start_ms": 200650,
      "end_ms": 201285,
      "text": "凭啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00078",
      "start_ms": 202150,
      "end_ms": 208555,
      "text": "因为他心里装着的是全国千千万万嗷嗷待哺的小婴儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00079",
      "start_ms": 209630,
      "end_ms": 212195,
      "text": "不是一个两个有钱人的太平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00080",
      "start_ms": 212750,
      "end_ms": 214190,
      "text": "他自个儿说的实在死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00081",
      "start_ms": 214210,
      "end_ms": 216455,
      "text": "疫苗是自个儿图省事的法子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00082",
      "start_ms": 216770,
      "end_ms": 222035,
      "text": "活疫苗才是给千百万个家正处的一条活路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00083",
      "start_ms": 223070,
      "end_ms": 224085,
      "text": "一九五九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00084",
      "start_ms": 224910,
      "end_ms": 232775,
      "text": "他从苏联好歹把活疫苗的门道连同几份金贵的种子材料带了回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00085",
      "start_ms": 233280,
      "end_ms": 234760,
      "text": "可一落地就傻眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00086",
      "start_ms": 234780,
      "end_ms": 236215,
      "text": "压根没地儿做实验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00087",
      "start_ms": 236890,
      "end_ms": 239270,
      "text": "要拿动武事就得有恒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00088",
      "start_ms": 239370,
      "end_ms": 244085,
      "text": "和侯北京城里一纸能用的都寻不着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00089",
      "start_ms": 245860,
      "end_ms": 246275,
      "text": "咋整？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00090",
      "start_ms": 248250,
      "end_ms": 251785,
      "text": "搬上云南昆明边上那片大山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00091",
      "start_ms": 252290,
      "end_ms": 253830,
      "text": "慌得兔子都不拉屎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00092",
      "start_ms": 253830,
      "end_ms": 254405,
      "text": "不通路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00093",
      "start_ms": 254870,
      "end_ms": 256305,
      "text": "没水没电。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00094",
      "start_ms": 256980,
      "end_ms": 258120,
      "text": "顾方舟干了一桩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00095",
      "start_ms": 258120,
      "end_ms": 260120,
      "text": "让大伙扶起到骨头里的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00096",
      "start_ms": 260120,
      "end_ms": 261880,
      "text": "他把自个儿的亲娘媳妇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00097",
      "start_ms": 262020,
      "end_ms": 263775,
      "text": "还有刚落地的小儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00098",
      "start_ms": 264050,
      "end_ms": 268010,
      "text": "一大家子全从北京碾上了山屠杀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00099",
      "start_ms": 268770,
      "end_ms": 270070,
      "text": "他要给中国盖头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00100",
      "start_ms": 270090,
      "end_ms": 271975,
      "text": "一座几会疫苗的研究所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00101",
      "start_ms": 272610,
      "end_ms": 274835,
      "text": "还得给手底下的人立个杆瞧瞧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00102",
      "start_ms": 275260,
      "end_ms": 277935,
      "text": "瞅见没我家当家的都来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00103",
      "start_ms": 278240,
      "end_ms": 279415,
      "text": "你们还哆嗦个啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00104",
      "start_ms": 280420,
      "end_ms": 282235,
      "text": "科研人员住的是窝棚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00105",
      "start_ms": 282590,
      "end_ms": 283345,
      "text": "是山洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00106",
      "start_ms": 283910,
      "end_ms": 286605,
      "text": "连间像人住的屋子都抠不出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00107",
      "start_ms": 287260,
      "end_ms": 288555,
      "text": "做实验的料子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00108",
      "start_ms": 288820,
      "end_ms": 291240,
      "text": "得先送到山脚下的冷库里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00109",
      "start_ms": 291240,
      "end_ms": 294305,
      "text": "镇着要用的时候再吭哧吭哧扛回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00110",
      "start_ms": 294510,
      "end_ms": 296285,
      "text": "就这么个苦哈哈的境地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00111",
      "start_ms": 296600,
      "end_ms": 297895,
      "text": "一回又一回的事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00112",
      "start_ms": 298350,
      "end_ms": 299665,
      "text": "熬到一九六零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00113",
      "start_ms": 300030,
      "end_ms": 301890,
      "text": "疫苗总算捣鼓出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00114",
      "start_ms": 302510,
      "end_ms": 303950,
      "text": "猴子身上没毛病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00115",
      "start_ms": 303950,
      "end_ms": 305690,
      "text": "可猴没事儿不代表人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00116",
      "start_ms": 305690,
      "end_ms": 306445,
      "text": "没事儿啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00117",
      "start_ms": 306970,
      "end_ms": 308690,
      "text": "谁敢头一个往嘴里灌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308890,
      "end_ms": 310310,
      "text": "谁又敢往娃嘴里灌？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00119",
      "start_ms": 310870,
      "end_ms": 315870,
      "text": "接下来这墓是全篇最叫人后脊梁冒凉气的一段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00120",
      "start_ms": 315930,
      "end_ms": 319770,
      "text": "顾方舟先抄起一瓶自个儿灌了个底朝天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00121",
      "start_ms": 320370,
      "end_ms": 322330,
      "text": "同时一把拦住顾老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00122",
      "start_ms": 322590,
      "end_ms": 323890,
      "text": "您可是带头的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00123",
      "start_ms": 324070,
      "end_ms": 325330,
      "text": "您要有个闪失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00124",
      "start_ms": 325590,
      "end_ms": 326710,
      "text": "后头可咋整？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00125",
      "start_ms": 327010,
      "end_ms": 329150,
      "text": "他甩出一句硬邦邦的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00126",
      "start_ms": 329670,
      "end_ms": 330470,
      "text": "我是党员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00127",
      "start_ms": 330790,
      "end_ms": 332390,
      "text": "我先来猴子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00128",
      "start_ms": 332390,
      "end_ms": 333350,
      "text": "他不会开口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00129",
      "start_ms": 333690,
      "end_ms": 337040,
      "text": "可我会只有拿自个儿身子试过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00130",
      "start_ms": 337240,
      "end_ms": 341160,
      "text": "我才最明白这玩意儿进到人肚子里是个啥动静。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00131",
      "start_ms": 341760,
      "end_ms": 345220,
      "text": "紧跟着好几个年轻科研人员也呼啦一下站起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00132",
      "start_ms": 345220,
      "end_ms": 346060,
      "text": "我也是党员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00133",
      "start_ms": 346360,
      "end_ms": 348460,
      "text": "算我一个这帮人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00134",
      "start_ms": 348840,
      "end_ms": 350660,
      "text": "就是咱中国头一搏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00135",
      "start_ms": 350900,
      "end_ms": 352520,
      "text": "拿命是药的硬汉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00136",
      "start_ms": 353640,
      "end_ms": 357680,
      "text": "结果咋样一个不少全都安然无恙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00137",
      "start_ms": 358640,
      "end_ms": 361860,
      "text": "可顾方舟胸口那块石头愣是没落地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00138",
      "start_ms": 362120,
      "end_ms": 365080,
      "text": "因为他冷不丁琢磨出一个要命的坎儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00139",
      "start_ms": 365080,
      "end_ms": 366085,
      "text": "他是大人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00140",
      "start_ms": 366560,
      "end_ms": 369765,
      "text": "大人早就被这病毒磨除抵抗力了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00141",
      "start_ms": 370500,
      "end_ms": 375595,
      "text": "可这病真正要人命的对象是那些三五岁的奶娃娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00142",
      "start_ms": 376170,
      "end_ms": 377535,
      "text": "大人喝了不碍事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00143",
      "start_ms": 378120,
      "end_ms": 380355,
      "text": "不等于孩子喝了也不碍事啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00144",
      "start_ms": 381260,
      "end_ms": 383725,
      "text": "那么问题就明晃晃的处在那了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00145",
      "start_ms": 384870,
      "end_ms": 395315,
      "text": "谁他娘的舍得拿自家的娃去烫这道雷下头这一段是我听过最揪心、最拧巴的父爱那阵子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00146",
      "start_ms": 395680,
      "end_ms": 398255,
      "text": "顾方舟最小的儿子刚落地没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00147",
      "start_ms": 398490,
      "end_ms": 401910,
      "text": "他做了一个往后余生都在担惊受怕的决定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00148",
      "start_ms": 401910,
      "end_ms": 408265,
      "text": "他瞒着伯姨悄悄的把那馆几回活疫苗喂尽了亲儿子的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00149",
      "start_ms": 409230,
      "end_ms": 411415,
      "text": "你把那画面在脑子里过一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00150",
      "start_ms": 411990,
      "end_ms": 415320,
      "text": "一个专攻病毒的专家亲手霸一馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00151",
      "start_ms": 415420,
      "end_ms": 416985,
      "text": "说不定要命的药水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00152",
      "start_ms": 417490,
      "end_ms": 420515,
      "text": "一滴一滴滴进自己青蛙的嘴里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00153",
      "start_ms": 421030,
      "end_ms": 423845,
      "text": "赌赢了娃平平安安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00154",
      "start_ms": 424140,
      "end_ms": 426555,
      "text": "赌输了他的心头肉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00155",
      "start_ms": 427110,
      "end_ms": 428605,
      "text": "轻则贪一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00156",
      "start_ms": 428830,
      "end_ms": 430375,
      "text": "重则把命搭进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00157",
      "start_ms": 431070,
      "end_ms": 432845,
      "text": "他后来念叨起这事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00158",
      "start_ms": 433080,
      "end_ms": 438180,
      "text": "语气平淡的像在说隔壁老张家的闲篇不这么干不成啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00159",
      "start_ms": 438300,
      "end_ms": 439665,
      "text": "你自己都不嫌尝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00160",
      "start_ms": 440140,
      "end_ms": 442305,
      "text": "你咋好意思让别人去尝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00161",
      "start_ms": 443250,
      "end_ms": 444795,
      "text": "你让人家去试，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00162",
      "start_ms": 445190,
      "end_ms": 446905,
      "text": "你自个儿良心过得去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00163",
      "start_ms": 447370,
      "end_ms": 449795,
      "text": "大伙儿听听这哪是心狠哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00164",
      "start_ms": 450320,
      "end_ms": 455905,
      "text": "分明是把刀刃对准了自己身上最软最疼的那块肉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00165",
      "start_ms": 456830,
      "end_ms": 462735,
      "text": "他那口子那边是彻彻底底被蒙在鼓里的那一个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00166",
      "start_ms": 463750,
      "end_ms": 467455,
      "text": "顾方舟天天半宿半宿的爬起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00167",
      "start_ms": 467950,
      "end_ms": 469205,
      "text": "摸娃的脑门儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00168",
      "start_ms": 469430,
      "end_ms": 470695,
      "text": "丁娃抽不抽筋儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00169",
      "start_ms": 470910,
      "end_ms": 472895,
      "text": "白天还得装的跟没事人一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00170",
      "start_ms": 473270,
      "end_ms": 474570,
      "text": "足足熬了一个月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00171",
      "start_ms": 474870,
      "end_ms": 477530,
      "text": "眼看儿子好好的一丁点差子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00172",
      "start_ms": 477530,
      "end_ms": 477915,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00173",
      "start_ms": 478240,
      "end_ms": 480165,
      "text": "他才敢跟媳妇儿挑明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00174",
      "start_ms": 480810,
      "end_ms": 482995,
      "text": "爱人一听又气又后怕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00175",
      "start_ms": 483340,
      "end_ms": 483800,
      "text": "半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00176",
      "start_ms": 483880,
      "end_ms": 484920,
      "text": "憋不出一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00177",
      "start_ms": 484920,
      "end_ms": 486880,
      "text": "哪个当娘的扛得住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00178",
      "start_ms": 486880,
      "end_ms": 487835,
      "text": "这种惊吓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00179",
      "start_ms": 488380,
      "end_ms": 490645,
      "text": "可就是这么个狼心狗肺的爹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00180",
      "start_ms": 491260,
      "end_ms": 500725,
      "text": "换回了千千万万个孩子的太平打那儿往后对比其他科研人员的侍灵娃也陆陆续续跟着服了疫苗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00181",
      "start_ms": 501160,
      "end_ms": 502135,
      "text": "入了观察组，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00182",
      "start_ms": 502700,
      "end_ms": 509135,
      "text": "这帮科研人员的宰成了咱中国头一波被唐玩护住的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00183",
      "start_ms": 509780,
      "end_ms": 510455,
      "text": "后来呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00184",
      "start_ms": 510640,
      "end_ms": 514455,
      "text": "顾方舟嫌那液体的疫苗又苦又难伺候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00185",
      "start_ms": 514840,
      "end_ms": 515600,
      "text": "脑子一转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00186",
      "start_ms": 515640,
      "end_ms": 516965,
      "text": "干脆做成糖丸呗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00187",
      "start_ms": 517430,
      "end_ms": 518215,
      "text": "我爱吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00188",
      "start_ms": 518540,
      "end_ms": 520375,
      "text": "还耐放好搬运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00189",
      "start_ms": 520990,
      "end_ms": 522755,
      "text": "打从六七十年代起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00190",
      "start_ms": 523150,
      "end_ms": 525025,
      "text": "糖丸就在全国撒开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00191",
      "start_ms": 525530,
      "end_ms": 529880,
      "text": "再犄角旮旯的山沟沟瓦也能美滋滋的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00192",
      "start_ms": 529880,
      "end_ms": 532095,
      "text": "含上一颗结局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00193",
      "start_ms": 532560,
      "end_ms": 533525,
      "text": "咱都晓得了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00194",
      "start_ms": 533860,
      "end_ms": 534780,
      "text": "九十年代后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00195",
      "start_ms": 534780,
      "end_ms": 543020,
      "text": "半截中国大地上再没冒出过一粒本土的小儿麻痹症跨进新世纪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00196",
      "start_ms": 543020,
      "end_ms": 543695,
      "text": "没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00197",
      "start_ms": 544000,
      "end_ms": 547700,
      "text": "顾方舟代表中国在消灭几回的认证书上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00198",
      "start_ms": 547780,
      "end_ms": 550315,
      "text": "一笔一划签下了自个儿的名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00199",
      "start_ms": 550910,
      "end_ms": 553015,
      "text": "他是拿亲儿子的命去赌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00200",
      "start_ms": 553730,
      "end_ms": 556935,
      "text": "赌赢了整整一代中国孩子的安康。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00201",
      "start_ms": 557840,
      "end_ms": 558440,
      "text": "顾方舟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00202",
      "start_ms": 558440,
      "end_ms": 561900,
      "text": "于二零一九年一月二日三时三十五分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00203",
      "start_ms": 561920,
      "end_ms": 564170,
      "text": "在北京因病世事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00204",
      "start_ms": 564250,
      "end_ms": 565905,
      "text": "享年九十二岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00205",
      "start_ms": 566680,
      "end_ms": 567375,
      "text": "说到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00206",
      "start_ms": 567670,
      "end_ms": 570640,
      "text": "我这眼眶是发烫的当爹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00207",
      "start_ms": 570740,
      "end_ms": 571840,
      "text": "当妈的都明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00208",
      "start_ms": 571840,
      "end_ms": 573545,
      "text": "孩子是身上掉下来的肉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00209",
      "start_ms": 573820,
      "end_ms": 574685,
      "text": "是命里的命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00210",
      "start_ms": 575670,
      "end_ms": 581655,
      "text": "可顾方舟硬生生把这块肉弯下来去填了全天下的娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00211",
      "start_ms": 582400,
      "end_ms": 585405,
      "text": "这样的人不该被遗忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00212",
      "start_ms": 585620,
      "end_ms": 587095,
      "text": "所以今儿个这条视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00213",
      "start_ms": 587660,
      "end_ms": 589495,
      "text": "你要是也被戳着了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00214",
      "start_ms": 589880,
      "end_ms": 590665,
      "text": "就点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00215",
      "start_ms": 591000,
      "end_ms": 591585,
      "text": "收个藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00216",
      "start_ms": 592050,
      "end_ms": 594145,
      "text": "顺手转给你身边的亲朋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00217",
      "start_ms": 594780,
      "end_ms": 599415,
      "text": "让咱们的娃娃的娃都晓得咱们今儿个能撒鸭子跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00218",
      "start_ms": 599860,
      "end_ms": 602285,
      "text": "能蹦能跳能疯能闹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00219",
      "start_ms": 602740,
      "end_ms": 606865,
      "text": "是因为老早以前有人把命压在了咱们身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00220",
      "start_ms": 607350,
      "end_ms": 608815,
      "text": "记着他顾方舟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_729eadbae4888843_s00221",
      "start_ms": 609090,
      "end_ms": 609760,
      "text": "唐湾爷爷。"
    }
  ],
